7
00:01:51,453 --> 00:01:52,453
FESTA DE BOAS-VINDAS

8
00:01:52,621 --> 00:01:54,914
- E aí, gatinha!
- Vai devagar!

9
00:01:56,249 --> 00:01:58,001
Beau, me larga!

10
00:01:58,043 --> 00:02:00,545
